{
 "id": "seg3",
 "title": "签名盖住什么",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 94.98,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "第一个边界，是用户的签名。",
   "spoken": "第一个边界，是用户的签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.48,
   "speechStart": 1.694,
   "speechEnd": 3.887
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "用户签的，是用户操作的哈希。",
   "spoken": "用户签的，是用户操作的哈希。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-01.wav",
   "start": 4.3,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 4.3,
   "speechEnd": 6.754
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "哈希怎么编码，决定了哪些字段受签名保护。",
   "spoken": "哈希怎么编码，决定了哪些字段受签名保护。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-02.wav",
   "start": 7.16,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 7.16,
   "speechEnd": 11.504
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "2023 年 3 月，Alchemy 披露过一个打包漏洞。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 3 月，Alchemy 批路过一个打包漏洞。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-03.wav",
   "start": 11.94,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 11.94,
   "speechEnd": 15.667
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "EntryPoint 的打包函数，直接读取动态字段的偏移量，没有检查。",
   "spoken": "EntryPoint 的打包函数，直接读取动态字段的偏移亮，没有检查。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-04.wav",
   "start": 16.08,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 16.177,
   "speechEnd": 21.073
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "结果，同一个用户操作，能算出不同的哈希。",
   "spoken": "结果，同一个用户操作，能算出不同的哈希。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-05.wav",
   "start": 21.5,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 21.5,
   "speechEnd": 25.058
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "不同的用户操作，也能算出同一个哈希。",
   "spoken": "不同的用户操作，也能算出同一个哈希。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-06.wav",
   "start": 25.48,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 25.576,
   "speechEnd": 28.358
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "示例 Paymaster 的签名，签完以后，内容仍能被改。",
   "spoken": "示例 Paymaster 的签名，签完以后，内容仍能被改。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-07.wav",
   "start": 28.82,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 28.914,
   "speechEnd": 33.334
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "EntryPoint 已经修复，没有已知损失。",
   "spoken": "EntryPoint 已经修复，没有已知损失。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-08.wav",
   "start": 33.76,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 33.857,
   "speechEnd": 36.39
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "第二个边界，是 Paymaster 自己的签名。",
   "spoken": "第二个边界，是 Paymaster 自己的签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-09.wav",
   "start": 36.78,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speechStart": 36.873,
   "speechEnd": 39.592
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "这是另一套签名，也要覆盖链 ID、nonce 和有效期。",
   "spoken": "这是另一套签名，也要覆盖链 ID、nonce 和有效期。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-10.wav",
   "start": 40.04,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 40.137,
   "speechEnd": 44.394
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "少了任何一项，就可能被重放或抢跑。",
   "spoken": "少了任何一项，就可能被虫放或抢跑。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-11.wav",
   "start": 44.82,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 44.82,
   "speechEnd": 47.827
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "第三个边界，是账户自己的验证逻辑。",
   "spoken": "第三个边界，是账户自己的验证逻辑。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-12.wav",
   "start": 48.24,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 48.24,
   "speechEnd": 51.468
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "验证只检查签名。",
   "spoken": "验证只检查签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-13.wav",
   "start": 51.9,
   "dur": 1.76,
   "speechStart": 51.9,
   "speechEnd": 53.438
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "验证写错了，执行的就是攻击者的调用。",
   "spoken": "验证写错了，执行的就是攻击者的掉用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-14.wav",
   "start": 53.88,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speechStart": 53.88,
   "speechEnd": 56.699
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "2024 年 3 月，Code4rena 审计了 Coinbase Smart Wallet。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 3 月，Code4rena 审计了 Coinbase Smart Wallet。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-15.wav",
   "start": 57.14,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 57.247,
   "speechEnd": 61.814
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "删除 owner 的操作，可以跨链重放。",
   "spoken": "删除 owner 的操作，可以跨链虫放。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-16.wav",
   "start": 62.24,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 62.24,
   "speechEnd": 64.848
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "各条链上，同一个位置的 owner 可能不同。",
   "spoken": "各条链上，同一个位置的 owner 可能不同。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-17.wav",
   "start": 65.26,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speechStart": 65.26,
   "speechEnd": 68.1
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "重放过去，可能删错人，甚至把账户永久锁死。",
   "spoken": "虫放过去，可能删错人，甚至把账户永久锁死。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-18.wav",
   "start": 68.52,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 68.52,
   "speechEnd": 72.95
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "修复后，改成传入 owner 地址，再核对。",
   "spoken": "修复后，改成传入 owner 地址，再核对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-19.wav",
   "start": 73.38,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speechStart": 73.38,
   "speechEnd": 76.217
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "Biconomy 的审计里，智能账户的实现合约可以被销毁。",
   "spoken": "Biconomy 的审计里，智能账户的实现合约可以被销毁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-20.wav",
   "start": 76.64,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 76.744,
   "speechEnd": 81.122
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-21",
   "text": "它的会话密钥模块，只限制单笔额度，不限制累计。",
   "spoken": "它的会话密钥模块，只限制单笔额度，不限制垒计。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-21.wav",
   "start": 81.58,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 81.58,
   "speechEnd": 85.425
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-22",
   "text": "所以，哈希和签名要覆盖规范的编码和链 ID。",
   "spoken": "所以，哈希和签名要覆盖规范的编码和链 ID。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-22.wav",
   "start": 85.88,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 85.88,
   "speechEnd": 90.488
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-23",
   "text": "多链账户的管理操作，要防重放。",
   "spoken": "多链账户的管理操作，要防虫放。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg3-23.wav",
   "start": 90.9,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 91.0,
   "speechEnd": 93.556
  }
 ],
